{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "TGKLQC576JQHBOL6JWJWEBT4EY77MWNI",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "041118001",
    "title": "氷の瞳のウマ娘",
    "enTitle": "The Icy Horsegirl",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（――虚ろに空いた穴がある。心の中に。暗く、深く）",
            "enText": "(I was familiar with emptiness. Like a gaping hole it lurked \nwithin my heart, a void dark and endless.)",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 278,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 3550814633815531816,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（私の心はその穴を――早く埋めろと追い立てる）",
            "enText": "(As if yearning to fill up its depths, \nmy heart's beat rushed me onward.)",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 174,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -2841749792238107325,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（たとえ、報われなかろうと）",
            "enText": "(Even if its desire may never be fulfilled.)",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 117,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -4853207321336662528,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（たとえ、終わりがなかろうと）",
            "enText": "(Even if its course may stretch forever.)",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 123,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 167,
                    "pathId": -5967318007591392417
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -6689368538881539020
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7545738532240895130,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（――そうすることしか、知らないのだから）",
            "enText": "(Because that is all it ever knew.)",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 144,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 13,
                    "pathId": 3517832208326061078
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7569728491092305870,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "“次世代の有望株”という話はトレーナー間でもよくされるが、\nここ最近決まって挙がる名前がある。",
            "enText": "The \"stars of the next generation\" are all too common of a topic \namong trainers. In recent times however, a particular name had \nbegun standing out.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 106,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "“アドマイヤグルーヴ”……ですか",
                    "enText": "Admire Groove…",
                    "nextBlock": 7
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8303597079182671100,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "先輩トレーナー",
            "enName": "Older Trainer",
            "jpText": "おう。ありゃ相当なモンだ。幼少期から“神童”なんて呼ばれてな。\n大きなレース大会で勝っても、まるで当然ってな顔してたらしい。",
            "enText": "That's right. Quite something, she is. Hailed as a prodigy \nfrom a young age. I heard she never looked surprised when \nwinning, even in the big tournaments. Like it was a given.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 351,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -8796948168560646804,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "同期のトレーナー",
            "enName": "Similarly-Aged Trainer",
            "jpText": "さすがは将来のクラシックGⅠ主役候補……。\nわたしもいつか、そんな子を担当してみたいなあ……。",
            "enText": "Not for nothing she's prospected to be a big name \nin the G1 classics, I see. Oh, how I wish I could be \nthe trainer of someone like her…",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 249,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -4852318757589031582,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "噂の“神童”の走りを見てみたくなり、グラウンドへ\n来てみたところ、これからちょうど走るようだった。",
            "enText": "I wanted to get a good look at this lauded prodigy, \nso I walked myself to the track. It looked like she \nwas just about to start running. Lucky me.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 108,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": 7279159240704336112,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……すぅー……はぁ……。\n……すぅー……。",
            "enText": "<i>…Hiiii… hooo… \n…Hiiii…</i>",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 243,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 283,
                    "pathId": 8096333707279907122
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 93,
                    "pathId": 8434558848364268256
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2135426470380471323,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "――ふぅっ！",
            "enText": "<i>Hoo…!</i>",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 44,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 58,
                    "pathId": 6694693067090649006
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 6254626074492652336
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5067760068947342078,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "快活なウマ娘",
            "enName": "Cheerful Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "……速っ！\nってゆーか……私たちの走りとは、なんか、根本的に違う……。",
            "enText": "…Look at her go! Heck… she's just built \ndifferent from the rest of us…",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 276,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（――間違いない。フォームだ……！）",
                    "enText": "(I can tell immediately. It's her form…!)",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 305,
                    "pathId": 5956106141999696251
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6286205822096788192,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "一切無駄のない美しいフォーム。それが全ての動作を、完璧に\n推進力へと変換している。その場の誰もが思わず息を呑んだ。",
            "enText": "It's beautiful. Devoid of nonnecessities. Every action perfectly \nconverted into forward motion. All those present were rooted \nto the ground in awe.",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 119,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 82,
                    "pathId": -6880685565379645761
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -1261181596000786538
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3979496338534949488,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "すでに第一線で活躍しているウマ娘たちの中でさえ、あれほど\n完璧なフォームを理解・実践できている者はほとんど居ない。",
            "enText": "Even among the higher levels of racers it would be difficult \nto find someone who not only understood the elements of \nform this well, but could effectively realize them so perfectly.",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 119,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 196,
                    "pathId": 6402252436705114880
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1946095993551893090,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "デビュー前からあの実力だ。きっと互いに高め合うライバルや、\n志を共にする同輩たちに囲まれているのだろう――",
            "enText": "And this before her debut. She <i>must</i> be driven by a fierce \nrivalry, surrounded by peers of equal ambition.",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 114,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（――と、思っていたんだけど……）",
                    "enText": "(Yet, as this thought entered my mind…)",
                    "nextBlock": 16
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 164,
                    "pathId": -8719328426636592962
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 6003950108475400099
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1260869742623961164,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "快活なウマ娘",
            "enName": "Cheerful Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "あ、あの……アルヴさん！\nわ、私も今年デビュー目指してるんだけど……！",
            "enText": "U-Umm… Arve! I'm… I'm aiming to debut \nthis year as well, and…!",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 214,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 282,
                    "pathId": 2060095636680242602
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 258,
                    "pathId": -6436632205064119879
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1269797599747262268,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "快活なウマ娘",
            "enName": "Cheerful Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "アルヴさんの走り――フォームとかペースとか、覚えたいの！\nよかったら、一緒にトレーニングさせて……！",
            "enText": "I really want to learn about your form and how you can \nbe so fast! Would you mind training together with me…?!",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 216,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 262,
                    "pathId": 1682758233284568768
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 258,
                    "pathId": 232618527387944607
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -585215420783916299,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "…………。私は誰とも組むつもりはないわ。\nだから、貴方の期待には応えられない。他をあたってちょうだい。",
            "enText": "…I don't intend to train with anyone. You're asking \nthe wrong person, try someone else.",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 396,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（……なんだか、そっけないな……）",
                    "enText": "(…She's pretty blunt…)",
                    "nextBlock": 19
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 102,
                    "pathId": -243133321977592753
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -5543256028597455331
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6314619825984199220,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "熱の籠もった誘いさえ、すげない態度で遠ざける。\n場の空気が冷めるのを後目に……彼女は独り走り出す。",
            "enText": "The girl's earnest request was coldly pushed aside. \nIndifferent to the resulting mood shift among onlookers, \nshe began running — alone.",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 108,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 58,
                    "pathId": 5123318449491206913
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 3036339289296510234
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5633873278531152648,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "はぁあああっ……！",
            "enText": "<i>Hraaaaah…!</i>",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 72,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "pathId": -3631868310196851594,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "はっ……はっ……はぁっ……はぁっ……！\nあと…………3本は、いけ――くっ……。",
            "enText": "<i>Haah… haa… haaah… haah…!</i>\nStill… three to go… <i>urk</i>.",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 302,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -4376706517982497182
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 6341921447679135050
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -9176528379674262755,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "む……？　アドマイヤグルーヴ……？\nどうした、大丈夫か？",
            "enText": "Hm…? Admire Groove…? Do you feel alright?",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 161,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 193,
                    "pathId": 8776759868762545115
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 123,
                    "pathId": -5265142106106333691
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 37,
                    "pathId": 179377556743136225
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 2768281569201918043
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1604782692502054981,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "よろめいたアドマイヤグルーヴに駆け寄ったのは――エアグルーヴ。\n華々しい戦歴を誇る、中央でもトップクラスのウマ娘だ。",
            "enText": "Air Groove had appeared and ran over to the staggering \nAdmire Groove. <i>She</i> was a top-class horsegirl with \na spectacular record, even for Central standards.",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 120,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 155,
                    "pathId": 7455361934579236365
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -4654539948551992657
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 141,
                    "pathId": 136870028104600527
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8780435767047700731,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……はっ……はっ……。\n……問題ありません。",
            "enText": "<i>Hah… hah……</i> I'm fine.",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 270,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": 9123554821185876904
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 1407552194515126435
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 182,
                    "pathId": -5713274781724562285
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -717025512127627993
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8192458499868606750,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "ふ……大した意気込みだ。ストイックさはいつもながら感心する。\nだが誰かと一緒ならば、見て学びながら休息できる。",
            "enText": "<i>Hmph</i>. You never fail to impress with your determination \nand discipline. However, had you the company of others, \nyou could still learn from observing them while taking a rest.",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 336,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 369,
                    "pathId": 8951592577784536783
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 279,
                    "pathId": -5889958056189650957
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 5570865098340735490
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5632803497991273624,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "よければ一度、私たちの所へ来てみないか？\n独学が悪いとは言わないが、集団の中で学べる事も――",
            "enText": "Why not join us this once? There's nothing wrong with \nworking on things alone, but learning in group is valuable \nin its own ——",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 258,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 396,
                    "pathId": 6391323515303499462
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 255,
                    "pathId": -5818425102195919373
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3013861751006305056,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……どうぞお構いなく。\n私には、私なりのトレーニング方針がありますから。",
            "enText": "…You needn't concern yourself with me. \nI have my own ways of training.",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 246,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 222,
                    "pathId": -7786781228848972430
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 263,
                    "pathId": 2679776440837295561
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5258236323589735212,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "自分を強くできるのは……自分だけ。\n……トレーニングメニューの続きがありますので、これで。",
            "enText": "Growing stronger is… something I alone am responsible for. \n…I have a training program to finish, so if you'll excuse me…",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 306,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 102,
                    "pathId": -6980643721601626137
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 1358135916691964993
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 339,
                    "pathId": 7770680455341327179
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3927078850919895581,
            "blockIdx": 28
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "どうやらエアグルーヴの言葉も届かなかったらしい。\n取りつく島もないとはこの事だろう。",
            "enText": "Even Air Groove's words seemed to fall on deaf ears. \nI guess you could call this an example of talking to a wall.",
            "nextBlock": 30,
            "origClipLength": 99,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 152,
                    "pathId": 4767281476930038666
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": -1194637084967016089
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3115112524148060564,
            "blockIdx": 29
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "アドマイヤグルーヴがトレーニングを終えて、戻ってきた。\nお節介といえばそれまでだが――",
            "enText": "After finishing training, Admire Groove returns trackside. \nPerhaps she'll just think me meddlesome, but…",
            "nextBlock": 31,
            "origClipLength": 101,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ええと、そこの君――",
                    "enText": "Excuse me…",
                    "nextBlock": 31
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "ええと、そこの貴方――",
                    "enText": "Excuse me…",
                    "nextBlock": 31
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -4240762560567796367
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": 3130295122672109924
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8938290216666478602,
            "blockIdx": 30
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……そのバッジ、トレーナーの方ですか……。\n私になにか？",
            "enText": "…That badge means you're a trainer. \nDid you need something?",
            "nextBlock": 32,
            "origClipLength": 259,
            "voiceIdx": 21,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "エアグルーヴに声をかけられていたよね",
                    "enText": "I saw Air Groove talking to you earlier.",
                    "nextBlock": 32
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 314,
                    "pathId": -1700753200863809782
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 341,
                    "pathId": 5045455131232645392
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5465097408603080912,
            "blockIdx": 31
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……別に、問題を起こしたりはしていません。\nトレーニングに誘われて、お断りしただけです。",
            "enText": "…It wasn't because I caused any issues. She invited me \nto train with her, and I declined. That's all.",
            "nextBlock": 33,
            "origClipLength": 304,
            "voiceIdx": 22,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 390,
                    "pathId": 825858782280150729
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 8206062947523791531
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4344693979668784677,
            "blockIdx": 32
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "煩わしいんです、そういうの。\n私に声をかける理由なんて、彼女にも本来ないでしょうに。",
            "enText": "I find that sort of attention bothersome. Surely <i>she</i> can't have \nintended to approach me when coming here, either.",
            "nextBlock": 34,
            "origClipLength": 294,
            "voiceIdx": 23,
            "choices": [
                {
