        {
            "jpName": "施設の園長",
            "enName": "Orphanage Director",
            "jpText": "貴方をトレセン学園へ送り出す日が来るなんてね。昔から何でも\nできる子だったし……貴方ならきっと大丈夫なのでしょうね。",
            "enText": "To think the day would come when we could see you off \nto Tracen Academy… I'm confident you'll do just fine. \nYou've always been a capable kid.",
