        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "自分を高めるのに、絆だの友情だの。\nそんなものの有無は無関係です。",
            "enText": "So-called bonds and friendship… I have no need of those. \nThey are irrelevant to my personal growth.",
